  m_text: "<color=#A380FF>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> The same lookups in C#:
    GetComponent<T>(), GetComponentsInChildren<T>(), Object.FindObjectsByType<T>(),
    FindFirstObjectByType<T>(). [Button] methods are plain methods.\n<color=#A380FF>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Scene workflow:</b> Clear 'Cam Find In Scene' on Attribute: the inspector
    refills it at once and Edit > Undo History lists 'Find attributed component'.
    Neoxider/Settings > Enable Attribute Search turns auto-fill off.\n<color=#A380FF>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Verification:</b> Play: Compare with C# reports 6 / 6 fields equal the C#
    queries; Kick bodies pushes the bodies of rbsFindAllInScene.\n<color=#A380FF>\xBB</color> 
    Actions on Attribute: set parameters, press Say or Get Money; output goes to
    the Console.\n<color=#A380FF>\xBB</color>  Select Attribute and [Demo] Inspector/Attribute
    B, press Add Score: both scores change, one Ctrl+Z reverts them."
